In 2015 Coca-Cola's own bottling business was 52% of its net revenues. By 2025 it was 12%. Here's why selling the factories made it stronger. Full documentary: {LONG}
Sources: The Coca-Cola Company (The Coca-Cola System); 2025 Form 10-K.
